# =============================================================================
# Minimal push: track only ``README.md``, ``api_server/``, ``my_sandbox_sdk/`` (+ root ``.env.example``)
# =============================================================================
# ``/*`` ignores every top-level path; ``!`` opt-ins what you push. Add more with e.g. ``!/ws_chat_probe.py``.
# =============================================================================

/*
!README.md
!/.gitignore
!/.env.example
!/api_server/
!/my_sandbox_sdk/

# Secrets & local (still ignored inside the folders above)
.env
.env.local
api_server/.env
my_sandbox_sdk/.env
*.db
*.log
**/__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.venv/
venv/
**/venv/
dist/
build/
*.egg-info/
**/.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/

# Optional: uncomment to track from this repo
# !/ws_chat_probe.py
# !/check_Code.py
# !/examples/
# !/e2b_shim/
# !/docs/
